<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Reconstruct</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 31)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast reconstruct &lt;item you carry&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster runs a hand along the item and chants 'nuva riforj', and it 
glows with a warm light as its wear is mended: between a sixth and a 
third of what it can take. It works on items still holding more than a 
quarter of their strength.
</p><p>It is the finest of the three mending spells. Like <a cmd='#'>Help Mending</a> and 
<a cmd='#'>Help Repair</a>, every casting costs the item something: the most wear it 
can ever take shrinks a little each time. But reconstruct costs only a 
sixteenth, half what repair costs and a quarter of what mending costs, 
for as much mending as repair gives. Indestructible items need none.
</p><p>You must be standing, and carry the item. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mending</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Repair</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Craftsmanship</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>